/output/full-block-concepts/lakeside-campground.png
/output/full-block-concepts/lumber-yard.png
/output/full-block-concepts/maintenance-depot.png
/output/full-block-concepts/nuclear-power-plant.png
/output/full-block-concepts/passenger-station.png
/output/full-block-concepts/quarry.png
/output/full-block-concepts/scrapyard.png
